        r.set("spatial_constraints",V::makeStr("Curve native.start/segments retain authored XYZ and optional constraints:[{type,id?,...}]. Handles: start, segment.N.end/through/pole.M/point.M (N,M are 1-based). Types fixed{point,value:[x,y,z]}, coincident{a,b}, distance{a,b,value:mm}, on_plane{point,plane}, on_axis{point,axis}, parallel/perpendicular/equal_length/coplanar{a,b,c,d}, angle{a,b,c,d,value:degrees}. Numeric coordinates are free; expression strings and start_ref/to_ref/through_ref datum anchors are driven. Damped equality solving rejects conflicts before publication; native_inspect report.spatial_constraints reports local rank/free_dofs/residuals, not global uniqueness. Edit constraints in Studio's 3D sketch constraints tool. Spatial source persists as document version34."));
